_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 3
---
order: 3
---
short_label: VII.3
---
statement: To find the greatest common measure of three given numbers not relatively prime.
---
red_highlight: yes
---
proof:

Let *A, B,* and *C* be the three given numbers not relatively prime.

It is required to find the greatest common measure of *A, B,* and *C.*

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="210" height="250" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="VII.3 diagram" src="propVII3.gif"/></noscript>
<script type="text/javascript">
